  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp oil-price volatility increases macroeconomic uncertainty and tightens financing conditions, prompting venture and corporate investors to delay or withdraw funds from high-risk AI development and compute projects.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">hormuz_standoff</data>
