  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Energy-driven market turbulence highlights failures or destabilizing behaviors of algorithmic/AI trading and automated logistics during shocks, triggering regulators to broaden oversight and legal pressure on AI deployment linked to market stability.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">hormuz_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_governance_crisis</data>
</edge>
