  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater short‑term oil price swings increase uncertainty about corporate earnings and macro outlooks for energy‑intensive economies, triggering larger cross‑asset repricings and elevating aggregate market volatility across equities, bonds and FX.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">hormuz_standoff</data>
