  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid depletion of munitions forces urgent foreign purchases and spot FX demand; conversely higher domestic stocks reduce emergency import‑driven currency pressure and the need for central‑bank FX intervention.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">currency_activism_shocks</data>
</edge>
