  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher munitions inventories reduce immediate procurement pressure and perceived market opportunity for defence‑related capacity expansion, which dampens private capital flows into relevant production and R&amp;D.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
