  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Frequent and severe transport and transshipment interruptions delay or raise the cost of delivering GPUs, specialized hardware, and integrated systems, increasing deployment lead times and costs that slow enterprises' pace of adopting large models and agentic systems.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
