  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased frequency and severity of port/rail/shipping interruptions create abrupt supply and demand mismatches for commodities and intermediate goods, producing spikes in equity, bond and FX volatility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">currency_activism_shocks</data>
