  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Damage and interdiction of Black Sea and nearby logistics nodes forces rerouting of cargo and energy flows onto longer corridors that increase transit volumes through Gulf chokepoints, raising commercial ship throughput via the Strait of Hormuz.</data>
