  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Improved political and operational cohesion among allied states enables coordinated policy instruments—joint export controls, shared certification requirements, and synchronized oversight actions—that increase the intensity and scope of regulatory scrutiny on AI developers and deployments.</data>
