  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Contraction of semiconductor production drives up advanced compute prices and reduces available training cycles, directly constraining the ability to train very large, highly autonomous models and thus lowering deployed model autonomy.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_governance_crisis</data>
