  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in domestic semiconductor production raises export receipts and improves the trade/current account profile over months, reducing downward pressure on the currency and thereby lowering the frequency and scale of central‑bank FX interventions.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">currency_activism_shocks</data>
