  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher autonomy levels allow deployment of persistent autonomous surface/underwater swarms and AI-directed interdiction tactics that can be fielded at scale to harass, disable or herd commercial traffic, increasing the practical effectiveness of localized blockades.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_governance_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">hormuz_standoff</data>
