  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Intensified FX interventions and associated capital‑controls by a sanctioned state or its partners stabilize payments corridors and hide transaction flows, directly undermining the effectiveness and detectability of sanctions enforcement.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">currency_activism_shocks</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
