  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden drop in net cross‑border capital flows reduces available venture and project funding and forces LPs and corporates to pull or delay commitments, causing a measurable decline in net capital allocated to model development, compute and AI services.</data>
